    <description>Version 5 logic: sets the brand Participating flag on the Project when an open opportunity exists for that brand. Brands: Cooling, Ingénia, TAMCO, Patterson-Kelley, Marley, Strobic. Chicago Fan is not included; it comes back with version 4 logic at Step 6. Handover Pack sections 4 and 7C.</description>
